 34AL c  2012Ro25: {+9}Be({+36}S,{+34}Al) at E({+36}S)=77.5 MeV/nucleon at      
 34AL2c  GANIL-LISE3. Measured T{-1/2}, |b and |g spectroscopy.                 
 34AL c  2001Nu01: U(p,X) at E=1 GeV at CERN-ISOLDE. Measured T{-1/2},          
 34AL2c  |b{+-}-delayed |g and neutron spectroscopy.                            
 34AL c  {+34}Al radius measurements:                                           
 34AL c  2006Kh08: {+34}Al produced by {+181}Ta({+48}Ca,X) fragmentation at     
 34AL2c  E({+48}Ca)=60.3 MeV/nucleon at GANIL. Measured energy-integrated       
 34AL3c  reaction cross sections at 30-65 MeV/nucleon using a silicon telescope 
