 34S 2c  resonance fluorescence. Used four Ge(Li) detectors at 0|', 90|',       
 34S 2c  180|', and 270|' (azimuthal angles relative to the polarization        
 34S 2c  plane of the linearly polarized beam) to measure parallel and          
 34S 2c  perpendicular asymmetries to determine parity.                         
 34S  c  1978Be46: {+34}S(|g,|g') E=18 MeV electron bremsstrahlung, nuclear     
 34S 2c  resonance fluorescence. Used 77.9%-enriched {+34}S target and Ge(Li)   
