 34S  c  1991Ke09, 1991Kh06: {+34}S(pol p,p') E=318 MeV, 67.92%-enriched {+34}S 
 34S 2c  target (powder in between thin beryllium foils). Used the              
 34S 2c  high-resolution spectrometer (at Los Alamos Meson Physics Facility) at 
 34S 2c  angles between 5|' and 39|'. Measured differential cross sections and  
 34S 2c  analyzing powers                                                       
 34S  c  1985Al03: {+34}S(p,p') E=29.8 MeV, target of 94.3%-enriched {+34}S on C
 34S 2c  backing. Used position-sensitive gas proportional counter (FWHM=20     
 34S 2c  keV) and measured angular distributions covering the angles from 15|'  
 34S 2c  to 120|' in steps of 5|'.                                              
 34S  c  1983Iv01: {+34}S(p,p') E=6 MeV, measured elastic and inelastic angular 
 34S 2c  distributions                                                          
 34S  c  1975Al28: {+34}S(p,p') E=1 GeV, target of 98.0%-enriched {+34}S. Used  
 34S 2c  magnetic spectrometer (quadrupole lens doublet, magnet, detecting      
 34S 2c  system of scintillator counters) and measured elastic and inelastic    
 34S 2c  differential cross sections                                            
 34S  c  1975Al08: {+34}S(p,p') E=1 GeV, same type of target and same           
 34S 2c  experimental setup as those in 1975Al28 (FWHM=1.6 MeV). Measured       
 34S 2c  elastic differential cross sections                                    
 34S  c  1974Gu26: {+34}S(p,p') E=5.4-6.2 MeV, 97.97%-enriched {+34}S thick     
 34S 2c  target (sulfur on glass plate). Measured excitation functions at       
 34S 2c  several angles and elastic angular distributions                       
 34S  c  1973Go42: {+34}S(pol p,p') E=24.5 MeV. Measured differential cross     
 34S 2c  sections and asymmetries (as function of angle) for inelastic proton   
 34S 2c  scattering                                                             
 34S  c  1969An35: {+34}S(p,p') E=6.03 MeV, 57.17%-enriched {+34}S InS target.  
 34S 2c  Used Si(Li) detector and measured elastic and inelastic angular        
 34S 2c  distributions, and differential cross section for elastic scattering   
 34S  c  1968Mo22: {+34}S(p,p') E=12.011 {I17} MeV, 85%-enriched {+34}S CdS     
 34S 2c  target. Used double focusing magnetic spectrometer and array of 16 Si  
 34S 2c  surface barrier detectors (FWHM=25 keV) at 20|', 60|', and 130|'       
 34S 2c  relative to beam direction.                                            
 34S  c  1985SaZS: {+34}S(pol p,p') E=65 MeV. Used high-resolution magnetic     
 34S 2c  spectrograph and measured angular distribution of the differential     
 34S 2c  cross sections and analyzing powers for a number of states             
 34S  c  1978BeXU: {+34}S(p,p') E=40 MeV, thick sandwich-type target. Used Enge 
 34S 2c  split-pole spectrometer and position-sensitive proportional counter    
 34S 2c  backed with plastic scintillator (additional runs on photographic      
 34S 2c  plates too).                                                           
